unigent (0.5.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

      * Major feature update from Colab v2:
      * - browser_fetch: Fetch JS-rendered web pages via Playwright
      * - send_email: SMTP email sending with TLS
      * - memory_semantic_search: TF-IDF semantic search with sklearn
      * - export_conversation: Export history to md/json/html
      * - structured_query: Get JSON responses from model
      * - workspace_diff: Track file changes since session start
      * - cancel_task: Cancel running queued tasks
      * - Added semantic_search() to EfficientMemory with TF-IDF
      * Updated README.md with SEO optimization for all features
      * Fixed CI/CD PyInstaller command (script path instead of -m)
      * All tests pass (15/15)

